+**Files:** 新增 `docs/ai/trial-guide.md`，修改 `docs/ai/README.md`、`apps/prototype/src/scenarios/bm-b/state-contract.md`；记录 `evidence/runtime/rn15-delivery/verification.md`、独立审阅与实际命令/结果。
